  2. [1mGive the script a session cookie[0m — if [38;5;153m/login[39m can mint one for a service account, the script just authenticates like
     any other client. Zero code change here.
  3. [1mSeparate read-only endpoint[0m — expose only the fields the dashboard needs at a new path, gated by its own token,
